{#- The FCA line every promotion carries: who the firm is, that the FCA authorises and regulates it, its FRN, and that
    capital is at risk. Used under the hero's chooser and at the foot of every page. -#}
{%- set r = site.regulation %}
<p class="wm-reg-line">{{ r.legalName }} is authorised and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority, FRN {{ r.frn }}{{ site.mode | demoTag }}. {{ r.capitalAtRisk or fca.capitalAtRisk }}{% if "fca" | enabled %} <a href="{{ 'regulatory' | href }}">Regulatory information</a>{% endif %}</p>
